1. check pes.log file with qm folder
2. run Run extraxt_single)structure.sh to get optimized initial scordinate opt.xyz
3. folder_go_in.sh to remove all files except opt.xyz and pes.log file
4. CC.pdb half (single strain) version copied from Test/all_demers/AA/new_model*
5. Then xleap.in with zeroed library
6. create prmtop.zeroed.new using create_correct_prmtop.pl
7. Run create_init_md.pl inside angle_0 folder and to get runmin and RST files, 
(this will run run.min and md also) >> min1.out min2.out md.out /// use submit_all_jobs.sh // see comand file
9. check for torsions 0.002-0.005

8. 
qm profile 

grep EUMP2 angle_*/pes.log | awk '{cf=627.509; split($1,a,"/"); split(a[1],b,"_"); angle=b[2]; split($NF,a,"D"); v1=a[1]; v2=a[2]; gsub(/\+/,"",v2); energy=sprintf("%.6f", v1*10^v2*cf); print angle"\t"energy}' |  sort -nk1,1 > qm_tmp4

mm profile

grep Etot angle_*/md.out  | awk '{split($1,a,"/"); split(a[1],b,"_"); print b[2]"\t"$4}' | sort -nk1,1  > mm_tmp3

9. 
parameters :
